WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.039
Step 1. Open the Files tab.

1.2
00:00:02.039 --> 00:00:07.473
You can take a photo with your device's camera and upload it to a patient or to an

1.3
00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:11.419
encounter. Open either one and select the Files tab.

2.1
00:00:11.419 --> 00:00:15.938
Step 2. Open the camera. Select Add Files, then Open Camera.

2.2
00:00:15.938 --> 00:00:20.779
Care opens the camera, and it fills the height of the screen.

3.1
00:00:20.779 --> 00:00:26.893
Step 3. Allow access to the camera. If the browser asks to use the camera, allow it.

3.2
00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:30.325
Care needs this access to show the camera.

4.1
00:00:30.325 --> 00:00:32.337
Step 5. Take the photo.

4.2
00:00:32.337 --> 00:00:37.545
Care shows the photo with three buttons that have icons and no text.

4.3
00:00:37.545 --> 00:00:43.177
Check keeps the photo, retake takes it again, and close removes it.

5.1
00:00:43.177 --> 00:00:46.765
Step 6. Keep the photo. Select the check button.

5.2
00:00:46.765 --> 00:00:51.855
Care closes the camera and opens the upload dialog with the photo.

6.1
00:00:51.855 --> 00:00:54.553
Step 7. Name and upload the photo.

6.2
00:00:54.553 --> 00:00:59.737
Enter a name in the File Name field, which is required and starts empty.

6.3
00:00:59.737 --> 00:01:01.605
Then select Upload.
